hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1018","We have Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala, we have Sufyan, we have Al-Zuhri, Abbad bin Tamim told me, on the authority of his uncle Abdullah bin Zaid, he said: I asked The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, reported on the authority of a man who found something while he was praying, and he said: “He does not leave until he hears a sound or feels a smell.”"
